2. Explain WHY the character feels or thinks that way according to the reader. The reader inferred this emotion based on the story text stating that "There used to be an alligator under my bed," implying the character would feel extreme fear due to the presence of a dangerous animal in their sleeping space.', 'Ooh, he is so scared! Alligators are super big and scary!', 'The reader and child discussed the character''s fear of alligators, with the child noting that they are big and scary.', '2026-10-12T04:58:09.949546+00:00', 'How do you think the boy feels about going to bed when he believes an alligator is under there?', 'CORRECT', NULL) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
